    "Once upon a time": "很久很久以前",
    "Long ago, the goddess Shiria gathered the world's fairy tales into one land: Fairyland. Villages grew up between the stories, and adventurers came from far and wide to explore them.": "很久以前，女神希莉雅把世界上所有的童話故事聚集在同一片土地上，那就是Fairyland。故事與故事之間建起了村莊，冒險者們從四面八方前來探索。",
    "Lately the tales have been going wrong. A Big Bad Wolf prowls the Snow White Forest. A Rat King has cut off the dwarves of Goldburg. A dragon drinks at the oasis in Genie Desert and scares away the caravans.": "最近，童話故事開始出差錯了。大野狼在白雪公主森林裡徘徊，鼠王切斷了黃金堡矮人們的道路，還有一條龍霸占了神燈沙漠的綠洲喝水，把商隊都嚇跑了。",
    "You arrive in Meadowbrook as a new adventurer, with the whole of Fairyland ahead of you.": "你以新手冒險者的身分來到了草溪村，整個Fairyland就在你的眼前。",
    "Walk": "移動",
    "Drag the stick in the corner, or tap the ground and your hero walks there.": "拖曳角落的搖桿，或點一下地面，角色就會走過去。",
    "Battle": "戰鬥",
    "Monsters jump out as you explore the wild. Battles take turns: attack, cast a skill or use an item.": "在野外探索時會有怪物跳出來。戰鬥是回合制：攻擊、施放技能或使用道具。",
    "Beat a group down to its last monster, weaken it below 20% health and throw a Seal Stone. Keep up to five.": "把怪物打到只剩最後一隻，將牠的生命值削到20%以下，再丟出封印石。最多可以擁有五隻。",
