    "Companions fight beside you and earn a share of battle EXP. Weaken the last wild monster standing to {percent}% HP or less, then throw a Seal Stone at it with Capture to befriend it (up to {count}). Trader Bo in Meadowbrook sells Seal Stones.": "夥伴會和你並肩作戰，並分得一部分戰鬥EXP。把最後一隻野生怪物的HP削到{percent}%以下，再用「捕捉」丟出封印石，就能和牠成為夥伴（最多{count}隻）。草溪村的商人阿波有賣封印石。",
    "No companions yet.\nElder Oak in Meadowbrook gives you an egg with the first quest: hatch it from your Bag.": "還沒有夥伴。\n草溪村的橡樹長老會在第一個任務送你一顆蛋：從背包裡孵化牠吧。",
    "Party & friends": "隊伍與好友",
    "Befriend adventurers you meet (walk up to one). Up to {count} friends can travel and fight with you, and they bring their companions. They fight on if you faint, and wait where you fell; a friend who faints wakes up at their own checkpoint. Walk up to them to set off together again.": "和遇到的冒險者交朋友吧（走到他們身邊）。最多{count}位好友可以和你一起旅行、戰鬥，還會帶上他們的夥伴。你倒下時他們會繼續戰鬥，並在你倒下的地方等你；倒下的好友則會在自己的存檔點醒來。走到他們身邊就能再次一起出發。",
